{
 "id": 1550459,
 "titulo": "October Minor Update Details (UPDATED)",
 "fecha": 1569826923860,
 "modificada": 1733039618916,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1550459",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1569821936904\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/4ca81699f18941228f12d2f7abac3384_1569821936904_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">CM Fragment here of the MARVEL Future Fight team.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The Phoenix Five is now complete! Namor and Magik’s Phoenix Five Uniforms are now available in MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">To celebrate the release of these 2 new Uniforms that embraced the power of the Phoenix Force, a New Uniform Collection has been added!</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">More details can be found below.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Added 2 New Uniforms</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Meet the characters that embraced the power of the Phoenix! Use their new power through their new uniforms.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">New Uniforms for Namor and Magik have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1569822076896\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e69e61c6b8a34f01ae64824371602aed_1569822076896_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The 2 new uniforms will be sold at a discounted price during the event period and can be purchased in the MARVEL Universe or the uniform Room even after the event period.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* 2 New Uniforms will become available for purchase after the maintenance</span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ 1 More Character Can Now Realize Their Potential</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This update will allow you to unlock Magik’s Potential and upgrade her to level 70.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1569822111650\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/55a3d616658b47fb90eba2a18462e1b8_1569822111650_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Uniform Collection [Phoenix Five]</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new New Uniform Collection has been added! Collect all Uniforms to receive awesome rewards.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1569822136709\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/02fb50240c9c4d09a311a3265e40a0ed_1569822136709_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#3498db;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Complete the Uniform Collection within the event period to receive additional rewards.</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Others</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Users who purchased the 200 Crystals from the Dollar Store had the correct VIP Points reflected to their account.</span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Made changes to some Danger Room Exclusive Skills</span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">-Sentry Gun:<br>\nSkill Energy Requirement: 10000 &gt; <span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">12500</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">-S.H.I.E.L.D.:<br>\nSkill Duration: 8 Seconds &gt; <span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">3 Seconds</span><br>\nBuff Type: Create Shield equal to 1000% of HP &gt; <span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">Invincible, Cleanse</span><br>\nBuff Area: Center of Map &gt; <span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">Entire Map</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">-Tornado:<br>\nMovement Speed: 3.5 &gt; <span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">5</span><br>\nMax Hit: 4 &gt; <span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">5</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">-Regenerate:<br>\nSkill Energy Requirement: 25000 &gt; <span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">15000</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>3. Fixed an issue with HawkEye's Ronin [Avengers End Game] Uniform skill \"Shadow Slash\" wherein the skill doesn't work properly if used on Special Mission,&nbsp;Story Mission, and Skill Preview. (Updated on 10/01 2:22 AM (UTC+0) | 9/30 7:22 PM (PDT))</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>4. Fixed an issue wherein purchase completion status is not released properly&nbsp;when canceling subscription products.&nbsp;(Updated on 10/01 2:22 AM (UTC+0) | 9/30 7:22 PM (PDT))</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1569821946119\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7ba0d82003e646c6927e68213b1013f1_1569821946119_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
}